Package: sv-firefox-config
Architecture: all
Depends: svent-core (>= 0.4.5), firefox-esr (>= 128.8), python3, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Svent Firefox privacy defaults and Web proxy presets
 Configures Firefox ESR with privacy policies, signed extensions downloaded
 from Mozilla Add-ons and managed local Burp Suite and SOCKS5 proxy presets.
 Preserves Firefox's default appearance and existing browser profiles.
